// Copy this file to `Local.xcconfig` (same directory) and replace
// the placeholder with your own Apple Developer team identifier.
// `Local.xcconfig` is gitignored so your team id never lands in
// source control. CI uses the `APPLE_TEAM_ID` repo secret instead
// and overrides at the xcodebuild level.
//
// Find your team id at https://developer.apple.com/account →
// Membership → Team ID.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_APPLE_TEAM_ID
